                            <p class="text-justify">
                                <strong>Gravitational Wave Turbulence</strong><br>Albert Einstein's theory of general relativity predicts the propagation of gravitational waves through the universe. Recent cosmological observations of gravitational waves have verified Einstein's hypothesis and has led to an immense interest in the dynamics of gravitational waves. My recent research has been on developing a theory for weak and strong nonlinear interactions of many gravitational waves and how this may lead to a new perspective of cosmological inflation.
                            </p>

